  "description": "Welcome to Home Rescue: Clean and Restore, a brand-new, relaxing hidden object adventure that brings the satisfaction of a deep clean right to your screen! \nStep into the shoes of Jane, the ambitious owner of a budding small cleaning agency. \n\nYour mission? \n\nTo explore incredible, beautifully designed homes, clear out the clutter, and restore them to their former glory!\nWhether you are finding misplaced items, tidying up gorgeous living spaces, or solving delightful mini-games, \nthis game offers a perfectly calm and satisfying seek-and-find experience from the comfort of your own home.\n\nTake your cleaning business to the next level with exclusive extras! \n\nThe Collector's Edition includes:\n18 Additional Bonus Locations: Keep the fun going with even more colourful rooms, unique items to find, and homes to restore.\nBrain-Teasing Extras: Enjoy 3 extra Mini-Games and 18 additional puzzles designed to delight true fans of the genre!\n\nAre you ready to grab your cleaning supplies and make these incredible homes shine? \nJoin Jane's agency and play Home Rescue: Clean and Restore Collector's Edition today!",
